      "issue": "The WIP has Adam call the woman «نسا», followed by a note claiming it means woman. This is not the ordinary Persian term «زن» and makes the naming statement unclear.",
      "original_language_evidence": "",
      "required_action": "Replace or explain the nonstandard term with an understandable Persian rendering for “woman,” preserving the stated relationship to man.",
      "target_reference": "GEN 2:23"
