      "issue": "The woman's reply ends with «مار مرا فریب داد» (the serpent deceived me), omitting the reference's concluding statement, “and I ate.”",
      "original_language_evidence": "",
      "required_action": "Add the woman's admission that she ate the fruit within the quoted reply.",
      "target_reference": "GEN 3:13"
