      "issue": "The WIP says that the killer's punishment will be seven times more severe than Cain's punishment (\"هفت برابر شدیدتر از مجازات تو\"). The reference instead promises that anyone who kills Cain will suffer vengeance seven times over; it does not establish a comparison with Cain's punishment.",
      "original_language_evidence": "",
      "required_action": "Revise the statement so that it communicates sevenfold vengeance on Cain's killer without adding a comparison to Cain's punishment.",
      "target_reference": "GEN 4:15"
    },
