      "issue": "The WIP adds that God took Enoch \"to his presence upward\" (\"به حضور خود به بالا برد\"). The reference states only that God took him away; the added destination and upward movement are not expressed there.",
      "original_language_evidence": "",
      "required_action": "Revise to retain God's taking Enoch without adding the destination or manner unless this clarification is supported by authorised translation policy.",
      "target_reference": "GEN 5:24"
