      "issue": "The WIP replaces the group name \"Nephilim\" with the interpretive description \"مردانی غول‌آسا\" (giant men). The reference retains the designation Nephilim and separately calls them heroes of old and men of renown.",
      "original_language_evidence": "",
      "required_action": "Review the terminology and preserve the identifying designation, or provide a non-interpretive rendering that does not equate the Nephilim with giants without stated project authority.",
