      "grammar_rule_ids": [],
      "issue": "The reference includes all animals, birds, and creatures that move along the ground. The WIP narrows the first group to \"چهارپایان\" (livestock), which can exclude non-domesticated land animals.",
      "original_language_evidence": "",
      "required_action": "Revise the animal term to cover the full animal category intended by the reference while retaining the following categories of ground-moving creatures and birds.",
