      "issue": "The WIP says people filled the earth with «شرارت» (evil/wickedness), whereas the reference specifies that the earth was filled with violence because of them. This removes the repeated violence motif that explains the announced judgment.",
      "original_language_evidence": "",
      "required_action": "Revise the wording to explicitly retain violence as the condition filling the earth, while preserving the causal connection to the people.",
