      "issue": "The WIP lists domestic and wild animals as «بزرگ و کوچک» (large and small), but the reference separately includes every creature moving along the ground and repeatedly specifies each according to its kind. The replacement category does not preserve the stated inclusion of ground-moving creatures.",
