      "issue": "The WIP renders Japheth's dwelling in Shem's tents as being made a partner in Shem's happiness (\"او را شریک سعادت سام گرداند\"). This replaces the reference image and assertion, \"may Japheth live in the tents of Shem,\" with a different benefit.",
